"w:die Tablette":[["Die {Tabletten} sind rezeptfrei.","The tablets are available over the counter.","Nominativ Plural"],["Höchstens drei {Tabletten} täglich.","At most three tablets a day.","Plural"],["Sie vergisst immer öfter, ihre {Tabletten} zu nehmen.","She forgets more and more often to take her tablets.","Nominativ oder Akkusativ Plural"],["Die {Tablette} ist in der Speiseröhre stecken geblieben.","The tablet got stuck in the oesophagus.","Nominativ Singular"]],
