"w:die Grammatik":[["Der Lehrer erklärt die {Grammatik}.","The teacher explains the grammar.","Nominativ oder Akkusativ Singular"],["Die deutsche {Grammatik} ist schwer.","German grammar is hard.","Nominativ Singular"],["Ich habe eine Frage zur {Grammatik}.","I have a question about the grammar.","Dativ Singular"]],
