"w:das Spiel":[["Wer hat das {Spiel} gewonnen?","Who won the game?","Nominativ oder Akkusativ Singular"],["Das {Spiel} war sehr spannend.","The match was very exciting.","Nominativ Singular"],["Kinder sind beim {Spielen} sehr kreativ.","Children are very creative when they play.","Dativ Plural"],["Über 20.000 Zuschauer kamen zum {Spiel} ins Stadion.","Over 20,000 spectators came to the match in the stadium.","Dativ Singular"]],
