"w:das Lied":[["Das {Lied} kenne ich aus dem Radio.","I know the song from the radio.","Nominativ Singular"],["Das Publikum applaudierte schon nach dem ersten {Lied}.","The audience applauded after the very first song.","Dativ Singular"]],
"w:das Radio":[["Das Lied kenne ich aus dem {Radio}.","I know the song from the radio.","Dativ Singular"]],
"w:singen":[["Frau Müller {singt} im Chor.","Mrs Müller sings in a choir.","Präsens"]],
"w:das Konzert":[["Das {Konzert} in der Stadthalle war toll.","The concert in the civic hall was great.","Nominativ Singular"],["Ich habe zwei Eintrittskarten für das {Konzert}.","I have two tickets for the concert.","Akkusativ Singular"],["Der Sänger gibt morgen ein {Konzert} in Mannheim.","The singer is giving a concert in Mannheim tomorrow.","Nominativ oder Akkusativ Singular"],["Seit dem {Konzert} habe ich einen Tinnitus im rechten Ohr.","Since the concert I have had tinnitus in my right ear.","Dativ Singular"]],
