"w:der Film":[["Der {Film} war lang und langweilig.","The film was long and boring.","Nominativ Singular"],["Im {Film} trägt er eine Zwangsjacke.","In the film he wears a straitjacket.","Dativ Singular"],["Abends streamt er deutsche {Filme}, um sein Hörverstehen zu üben.","In the evening he streams German films to practise listening.","Plural"]],
