"w:der Akku":[["Mein Handy hat keinen {Akku} mehr.","My phone has no battery left.","Akkusativ Singular"],["Der {Akku} meines Handys ist schon wieder leer.","My phone's battery is empty again.","Nominativ Singular"]],
